			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 741210801,
					"content": "自由！啊啊，甜美的自由！雖然不如烤雞香，但還是很甜美！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210802
					],
					"speakerTitle": "恩里"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210802,
					"content": "…所以說，你手裡的牌子到底是什麼意思？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210803
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210803,
					"content": "嗯？這個啊，這是「抗議」的意思。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210804
					],
					"speakerTitle": "恩里"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210804,
					"content": "抗議什麼？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210805
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741210805,
					"content": "唔，怎麼說呢…他們，也就是把我埋在地裡的那些人，他們不希望我努力工作，所以我要抗議！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210806
					],
					"speakerTitle": "恩里"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210806,
					"content": "不對，為什麼有人不希望你努力工作呀？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210807
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210807,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210808
					],
					"speakerTitle": "恩里"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210808,
					"content": "妳能保密嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210809
					],
					"speakerTitle": "恩里"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210809,
					"content": "嗯！當然可以！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210810
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210810,
					"content": "那我也可以。這個的確不方便說。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210811
					],
					"speakerTitle": "恩里"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210811,
					"content": "什麼嘛！可惡！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210812
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210812,
					"content": "還是聊點別的吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210813
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741210813,
					"content": "好吧…那這個桶子又是怎麼回事？身上套著桶子，也是抗議的一種形式嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210814
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210814,
					"content": "啊？這個我不知道…他們把我埋起來之前，在我胸口套了個桶子，真是惡趣味！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210815
					],
					"speakerTitle": "恩里"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210815,
					"content": "那恩里又是為什麼被他們埋起來的呀？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210816
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210816,
					"content": "因為那些人壞透了！無緣無故就把我抓起來，埋在砂土裡！這些人，就想要我死！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210817
					],
					"speakerTitle": "恩里"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210817,
					"content": "真的是無緣無故嗎…？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210818
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741210818,
					"content": "#當、當然！{F#妳}{M#你}看，他們都把我埋在土裡了啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210819
					],
					"speakerTitle": "恩里"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210819,
					"content": "如果不是為了要我的命，怎麼會把我埋在土裡！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741210820
					],
					"speakerTitle": "恩里"
				},
				{
					"id": 741210820,
					"content": "#唔，感覺恩里說的話也有點道理…{NICKNAME}，{F#妳}{M#你}覺得呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
